#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.view_page_home
msgid ""
"\" Installing their charging stations in our parking lot doubled our foot "
"traffic. Customers linger, charge up, and shop while they wait. \""
msgstr ""
"\" ການຕິດຕັ້ງສະຖານີສາກໄຟຂອງພວກເຂົາໃນລານຈອດລົດຂອງພວກເຮົາ "
"ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຈຳນວນລູກຄ້າທີ່ຍ່າງເຂົ້າມາເປັນສອງເທົ່າ. ລູກຄ້າໃຊ້ເວລາຢູ່ນານຂຶ້ນ, ສາກໄຟ, ແລະ "
"ຊື້ເຄື່ອງໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ລໍຖ້າ. \""

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.view_page_home
msgid ""
"\" Switching to solar cut our energy bill in half within the first "
"quarter.&amp;nbsp;Best business decision we've made all year&amp;nbsp;\""
msgstr ""
"\" "
"ການປ່ຽນມາໃຊ້ພະລັງງານແສງຕາເວັນຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຄ່າໄຟຟ້າຂອງພວກເຮົາລົງເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງພາຍໃນໄຕມາດທຳອິດ.&amp;nbsp;ເປັນການຕັດສິນໃຈທາງທຸລະກິດທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນຮອບປີຂອງພວກເຮົາ&amp;nbsp;"
"\""

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.view_page_home
msgid ""
"\" The battery storage system kept us running through two outages last "
"winter. Reliable, sleek, and honestly kind of fun to show off to "
"clients&amp;nbsp;\""
msgstr ""
"\" "
"ລະບົບເກັບໄຟຟ້າສຳຮອງດ້ວຍໝໍ້ໄຟຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາດດຳເນີນງານຕໍ່ເນື່ອງຕະຫຼອດໄລຍະໄຟດັບສອງຄັ້ງໃນລະດູໜາວຜ່ານມາ. "
"ໝັ້ນໃຈໄດ້, ສວຍງາມທັນສະໄໝ, ແລະ ພູມໃຈແທ້ໆ ທີ່ໄດ້ອວດໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າເຫັນ&amp;nbsp;\""

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"- Assigned user will confirm the Repair, start the repair, finish the "
"repairing work and inform the Helpdesk user for the same through Chatter "
"functionality."
msgstr ""
"- ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບມອບໝາຍຈະຢືນຢັນການສ້ອມແປງ, ເລີ່ມການສ້ອມແປງ, ສິ້ນສຸດວຽກສ້ອມແປງ ແລະ "
"ແຈ້ງເຕືອນຜູ້ໃຊ້ຝ່າຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (Helpdesk) ຜ່ານຟັງຊັນສົນທະນາ (Chatter)."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"- Customer can <font style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\"><strong>raise a "
"ticket</strong></font> to Customer Care team for Repair through mail, "
"\"Submit a Ticket\" form or clicking on Chat bot button in Help page in "
"Website. Support\n"
"            Ticket will be generated in Helpdesk app."
msgstr ""
"- ລູກຄ້າສາມາດ <font style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\"><strong>ສ້າງປີ້ແຈ້ງບັນຫາ</"
"strong></font> ຫາທີມງານດູແລລູກຄ້າເພື່ອແຈ້ງສ້ອມແປງຜ່ານທາງອີເມວ, ແບບຟອມ \"ສົ່ງປີ້ແຈ້ງບັນຫາ\" ຫຼື "
"ກົດປຸ່ມແຊັດບັອດ (Chat bot) ໃນໜ້າຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຂອງເວັບໄຊ. ປີ້ແຈ້ງບັນຫາ\n"
"            ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນແອັບ Helpdesk."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"- Helpdesk User will create Repair in draft mode and fills up Customer's "
"details in it like equipment to be repaired, warranty end date, etc."
msgstr ""
"- ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຝ່າຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (Helpdesk) ຈະສ້າງລາຍການສ້ອມແປງໃນສະຖານະຮ່າງ ແລະ "
"ປ້ອນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລູກຄ້າໃສ່ ເຊັ່ນ: ອຸປະກອນທີ່ຈະສ້ອມແປງ, ວັນໝົດປະກັນ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"- Helpdesk user will confirm with the customer whether they will pick up the "
"equipment from repairing site or request to deliver the equipment to their "
"address."
msgstr ""
"- ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຝ່າຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (Helpdesk) ຈະຢືນຢັນກັບລູກຄ້າວ່າຈະມາຮັບອຸປະກອນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງຢູ່ສະຖານທີ່ສ້ອມແປງ ຫຼື "
"ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຈັດສົ່ງອຸປະກອນໄປຫາທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງເຂົາເຈົ້າ."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"- In case of delivery to customer's address, Helpdesk user will communicate "
"with the customer after delivery and take confirmation from customer about "
"equipment working and\n"
"            <strong><font style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\">closes the "
"Ticket</font></strong><font style=\"color: rgb(181, 214, 165);\">.</font>"
msgstr ""
"- ໃນກໍລະນີຈັດສົ່ງໄປຫາທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງລູກຄ້າ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຝ່າຍຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ (Helpdesk) ຈະຕິດຕໍ່ກັບລູກຄ້າຫຼັງຈາກຈັດສົ່ງແລ້ວ "
"ແລະ ຂໍການຢືນຢັນຈາກລູກຄ້າກ່ຽວກັບການໃຊ້ງານຂອງອຸປະກອນ ແລ້ວ\n"
"            <strong><font style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\">ປິດປີ້ແຈ້ງບັນຫາ</"
"font></strong><font style=\"color: rgb(181, 214, 165);\">.</font>"

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"- In case of pick up, ticket will be closed after customer's confirmation of "
"checking equipment at repairing site."
msgstr ""
"- ໃນກໍລະນີມາຮັບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ປີ້ແຈ້ງບັນຫາຈະຖືກປິດຕໍ່ເມື່ອລູກຄ້າໄດ້ກວດກາອຸປະກອນ ແລະ "
"ຢືນຢັນຢູ່ສະຖານທີ່ສ້ອມແປງແລ້ວ."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"- Inventory user <strong><font style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\">will "
"validate</font></strong> returned equipment in Return and check the <font "
"style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\"><strong>warranty end date</strong></"
"font>. If the\n"
"            warranty date is not under the warranty period, an invoice will "
"be raised for the parts replaced and repairing charge."
msgstr ""
"- ຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບສາງສິນຄ້າ <strong><font style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);"
"\">ຈະກວດສອບຢືນຢັນ</font></strong> ອຸປະກອນທີ່ສົ່ງຄືນໃນລາຍການສົ່ງຄືນ ແລະ ກວດເບິ່ງ <font "
"style=\"color: rgb(107, 165, 74);\"><strong>ວັນໝົດປະກັນ</strong></font>. ຖ້າຫາກ\n"
"            ກາຍກຳນົດປະກັນແລ້ວ, ໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບຄ່າອາໄຫຼ່ທີ່ປ່ຽນໃໝ່ ແລະ "
"ຄ່າແຮງງານສ້ອມແປງ."

#. module: solar_installation
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:solar_installation.welcome_article_body
msgid "- Warranty end date is fetched from delivery of the equipment."
msgstr "- ວັນໝົດປະກັນແມ່ນດຶງມາຈາກຂໍ້ມູນການຈັດສົ່ງອຸປະກອນ."

